    "b-sks-rc-evidence-stores-body": {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Five knowledge sources back the five kinds, in two classes. Archival sources — the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "discord://",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " archive, the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "pr://",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " past-PR index, the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "wiki://",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " mirrored corpus — are raw inputs, frozen once ingested: new material appends and gets indexed, existing rows never change, so a locator into them cannot drift and carries no digest. Operational sources are "
        },
        {
          "insert": "attempt://",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — the target ledger wearing its evidence hat, growing every run, its rows immutable — and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "code://",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", the active checkout and the only drifting source, where the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "digest",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " requirement and drift detection apply. Standards are part of the knowledge system but outside the knowledge graph: QA-owned, deliberately authored rules injected at worker boot and enforced at the ship gate. They are not a knowledge source and are never citable as evidence — the enum having no "
        },
        {
          "insert": "standards",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " entry is deliberate."
        }
      ],
      "id": "b-sks-rc-evidence-stores-body",
      "children": []
    },
